{
  "_comment": [
    "Artifacts that exist with ZERO consumers, already known. This list may only SHRINK.",
    "A NEW zero-consumer artifact fails the gate; an entry here that has since gained a",
    "consumer ALSO fails, so this cannot become a place findings go to be forgotten.",
    "Regenerate deliberately with --write-baseline; never to make a red run green.",
    "documentTemplateImport.ts::storeOriginalDocx is banked deliberately, not forgotten:",
    "the detector counts only non-service callers, but it is reached from UI \u2014",
    "pages/documents/templates/editor.tsx -> documentTemplateSave.saveDocumentTemplate",
    "-> storeOriginalDocx (the save-original-DOCX write inside the template save flow).",
    "2026-09-24 (bsuite#3327): the persistence detector was sharpened three ways \u2014 it follows ONE hop",
    "page -> store action -> service (a screen must import the store AND use the wrapping action),",
    "and it no longer counts test files or a same-named identifier in ANOTHER app. Eight entries left",
    "the list because a screen genuinely reaches them (crm7 form-layout CRUD, BSU ideas). Sixteen",
    "entered because only tests or another app had been hiding them; they predate this change and are",
    "tracked for wiring in the issue linked from bsuite#3327. braden createPage stays: its only",
    "'consumer' was a crm7 route test holding a local variable of the same name."
  ],
